{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Speed Up Video 是一款專為調整影片速度而設的實用工具，讓用家可以快速改變影片的播放速度，並以無浮水印方式儲存成品。無論是影片編輯新手還是資深攝錄愛好者，都能利用它輕鬆製作縮時攝影或慢動作作品。目前這款 App 正進行限時免費，原價 US $4.99，適合立即下載體驗。</p>\n\n<h2>重點功能一覽</h2>\n<p>Speed Up Video 支援最高 10 倍加速與低至 1/10 的慢動作效果，並能獨立調整影片中不同段落的速度，令場景之間的轉換更為流暢。輸出時不會加入任何浮水印，同時保留完整解像度，方便用家將成品直接儲存或分享到其他平台。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-342-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-343-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-344-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-345-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2048x2732bb-35-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2048x2732bb-36-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Speed Up Video</li>\n<li>應用類別：Graphics &amp; Design</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-31T08:39:30.869334+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":322,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}